OpenVids started from a snapshot of the HyperFrames source tree. Files taken
from that snapshot have been modified by the OpenVids authors, and new files
have been added, including the desktop shell (apps/desktop), the agent protocol
and agent runtime (packages/agent-protocol, packages/agent-runtime) and the
editing, analysis, story, research and render QA services. The history of this
repository records every change made after the initial import.

